          "lemma": "Андре́й Серге́евич Орло́в",
          "pos": "prop. n.",
          "en": "Andrey Sergeyevich Orlov’s",
          "note": "Orlov, the landowner, named by first name and patronymic.",
          "form": "gen. sg."
